  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inkomende Missie Vietnam Global Shrimp Forum</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Connect project-level initiatives with national sector development strategies and regulatory frameworks. Their presence can help translate insights from the forum into policy discussions on sustainable shrimp development, climate adaptation and export competitiveness. The visit to the Netherlands will add value to the strategic relations between Netherland and Vietnam and will facilitate further cooperation in the combi track aquaculture.</narrative>
